{"id":"03e824dfa6ba6c3a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/365_SKI_组合演算.md","title":"365 SKI 组合演算","display":"365_SKI_组合演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"365-SKI-组合演算\">365 SKI 组合演算</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。固定可数无限变量集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始组合子集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Comb}_{SKI}=\\{S,K,I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Comb}_{SKI}=\\{S,K,I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 组合子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项闭包\">2. 项闭包</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{I}\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\">\\(\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{I}\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\">\\(M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>应用显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MN\">\\(MN\\)</span> 并左结合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量与替换\">3. 自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV(\\operatorname{S})=FV(\\operatorname{K})=FV(\\operatorname{I})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV(\\operatorname{S})=FV(\\operatorname{K})=FV(\\operatorname{I})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=FV(M)\\cup FV(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=FV(M)\\cup FV(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{S})=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{K})=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{I})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{S})=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{K})=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{I})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{SKI}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{SKI}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[x:=N]\">\\(M[x:=N]\\)</span>，定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{S}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{S},\\quad\n\\operatorname{K}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{K},\\quad\n\\operatorname{I}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{I},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{S}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{S},\\quad\n\\operatorname{K}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{K},\\quad\n\\operatorname{I}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{I},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha\\)</span> 为文字等同。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-规约规则\">4. 规约规则</h1>\n<p>根规约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{SKI}\">\\(\\to^0_{SKI}\\)</span> 由三族组成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{I},X)\\to^0_{SKI}X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{I},X)\\to^0_{SKI}X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K},X),Y)\\to^0_{SKI}X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K},X),Y)\\to^0_{SKI}X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},X),Y),Z)\\to^0_{SKI}\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},X),Y),Z)\\to^0_{SKI}\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,I}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{I},X),X):X\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,I}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{I},X),X):X\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K},X),Y),X):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K},X),Y),X):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,S}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):\nX,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,S}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):\nX,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{SKI}=\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,I}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,K}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,S}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{SKI}=\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,I}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,K}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,S}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\">\\(\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\\)</span> 为满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{hole}_{SKI}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\">\\(\\operatorname{hole}_{SKI}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appL}_{SKI}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\">\\(\\operatorname{appL}_{SKI}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appR}_{SKI}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\">\\(\\operatorname{appR}_{SKI}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填孔函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{hole}_{SKI},M)=M,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{hole}_{SKI},M)=M,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{appL}_{SKI}(C,P),M)=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,M),P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{appL}_{SKI}(C,P),M)=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,M),P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{appR}_{SKI}(P,C),M)=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{appR}_{SKI}(P,C),M)=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。一步规约为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_{SKI}\n=\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI},\\ M\\to^0_{SKI}N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_{SKI}\n=\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI},\\ M\\to^0_{SKI}N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限规约对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\,M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\,M_i\\to_{SKI}M_{i+1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\,M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\,M_i\\to_{SKI}M_{i+1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\to^*_{SKI}N\">\\(M\\to^*_{SKI}N\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI}\\)</span>，其首项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-等式推导\">5. 等式推导</h1>\n<p>定义等式证明的单步规则关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\to_{SKI}N\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):N\\to_{SKI}M\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\to_{SKI}N\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):N\\to_{SKI}M\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>SKI 等式证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})\">\\((M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})\\)</span>，其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\">\\(M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\)</span>，并且每个相邻对满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_i\\to_{SKI}M_{i+1}\">\\(M_i\\to_{SKI}M_{i+1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_{i+1}\\to_{SKI}M_i\">\\(M_{i+1}\\to_{SKI}M_i\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_i\\equiv_\\alpha M_{i+1}\">\\(M_i\\equiv_\\alpha M_{i+1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=_{SKI}N\">\\(M=_{SKI}N\\)</span> 当且仅当存在首项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>、末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 的 SKI 等式证明。\n初始项族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{I}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{I}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>SKI 等式证明对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\ M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\ ((\\langle M_i\\rangle,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\ M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\ ((\\langle M_i\\rangle,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{SKI}=(\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{I},\\to^0_{SKI}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{SKI}=(\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{I},\\to^0_{SKI}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规约与证明关系均作为类型化关系给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\quad\n\\to_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}^{&lt;\\omega},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\quad\n\\to_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}^{&lt;\\omega},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个证明步必须是三族根规约的应用上下文闭包、其逆向，或文字等同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=_{SKI}N\">\\(M=_{SKI}N\\)</span> 当且仅当存在这种首项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>、末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 的有限对象。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-三族根规则的类型\">6. 三族根规则的类型</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,S}\">\\(\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,S}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,K}\">\\(\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,K}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,I}\">\\(\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,I}\\)</span> 分别为第 4 节三个显示根规约族，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{SKI}\n=\n\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,S}\\cup\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,K}\\cup\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,I}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{SKI}\n=\n\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,S}\\cup\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,K}\\cup\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,I}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于 SKI 没有绑定构造子，固定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{SKI}=\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{SKI}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{SKI}=\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{SKI}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明端点证书\">7. 证明端点证书</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{SKI}(M,N)\n=\n\\{\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI}:\\pi_0=M\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{SKI}(M,N)\n=\n\\{\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI}:\\pi_0=M\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=_{SKI}N\">\\(M=_{SKI}N\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{SKI}(M,N)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{SKI}(M,N)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；每个证书的每个相邻步都回指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI}\\)</span>，端点也明确属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-最终系统\">8. 最终系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{SKI}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Comb}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},FV,\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI},\\operatorname{Sub}_{SKI},\\equiv_\\alpha^{SKI},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Delta}_{SKI},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI},\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,S},\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,K},\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,I},\\to^0_{SKI},\\to_{SKI},\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI},\\to^*_{SKI},\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI},\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{SKI},=_{SKI}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{SKI}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Comb}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},FV,\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI},\\operatorname{Sub}_{SKI},\\equiv_\\alpha^{SKI},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Delta}_{SKI},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI},\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,S},\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,K},\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,I},\\to^0_{SKI},\\to_{SKI},\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI},\\to^*_{SKI},\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI},\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{SKI},=_{SKI}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"8.1-完成核对\">8.1 完成核对</h2>\n<p>本文只以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,K,I\">\\(S,K,I\\)</span> 为原始组合子，并给出三族根规约、上下文闭包、多步规约和等式证明。系统不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C,W\">\\(B,C,W\\)</span> 原始组合子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"365-SKI-组合演算","text":"365 SKI 组合演算","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项闭包","text":"2. 项闭包","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量与替换","text":"3. 自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-规约规则","text":"4. 规约规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-等式推导","text":"5. 等式推导","level":1},{"id":"6.-三族根规则的类型","text":"6. 三族根规则的类型","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明端点证书","text":"7. 证明端点证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-最终系统","text":"8. 最终系统","level":1},{"id":"8.1-完成核对","text":"8.1 完成核对","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Comb}_{SKI}=\\{S,K,I\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{I}\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"MN","display":false},{"tex":"FV:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}).","display":true},{"tex":"FV(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV(\\operatorname{S})=FV(\\operatorname{K})=FV(\\operatorname{I})=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"FV(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=FV(M)\\cup FV(N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{S})=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{K})=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{I})=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI}(N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{SKI}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":true},{"tex":"M[x:=N]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{S}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{S},\\quad\n\\operatorname{K}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{K},\\quad\n\\operatorname{I}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{I},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\to^0_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{I},X)\\to^0_{SKI}X,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K},X),Y)\\to^0_{SKI}X,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},X),Y),Z)\\to^0_{SKI}\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,I}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{I},X),X):X\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K},X),Y),X):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,S}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):\nX,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\to^0_{SKI}=\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,I}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,K}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{SKI,S}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{hole}_{SKI}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{appL}_{SKI}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{appR}_{SKI}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{hole}_{SKI},M)=M,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{appL}_{SKI}(C,P),M)=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,M),P),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(\\operatorname{appR}_{SKI}(P,C),M)=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,M))","display":true},{"tex":"\\to_{SKI}\n=\\{(\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,M),\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI},\\ M\\to^0_{SKI}N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n>0,\\forall i<n\\,M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\forall i+1<n\\,M_i\\to_{SKI}M_{i+1}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"M\\to^*_{SKI}N","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\to_{SKI}N\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):N\\to_{SKI}M\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})","display":false},{"tex":"M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"M_i\\to_{SKI}M_{i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"M_{i+1}\\to_{SKI}M_i","display":false},{"tex":"M_i\\equiv_\\alpha M_{i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"M=_{SKI}N","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{I}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n>0,\\forall i<n\\ M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\forall i+1<n\\ ((\\langle M_i\\rangle,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Delta}_{SKI}=(\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\operatorname{I},\\to^0_{SKI}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\to^0_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\quad\n\\to_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}^{<\\omega},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}^{<\\omega}.","display":true},{"tex":"M=_{SKI}N","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\to^0_{SKI}\n=\n\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,S}\\cup\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,K}\\cup\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,I}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\alpha^{SKI}=\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{SKI}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{SKI}(M,N)\n=\n\\{\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI}:\\pi_0=M\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"M=_{SKI}N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{SKI}(M,N)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{SKI}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Comb}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Tm}_{SKI},FV,\\operatorname{BV}_{SKI},\\operatorname{Sub}_{SKI},\\equiv_\\alpha^{SKI},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Delta}_{SKI},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SKI},\\operatorname{plug}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,S},\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,K},\\mathsf{Root}_{SKI,I},\\to^0_{SKI},\\to_{SKI},\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SKI},\\to^*_{SKI},\\mathsf{Rule}_{SKI},\\mathsf{Der}_{SKI},\\mathsf{ConvObj}_{SKI},=_{SKI}).","display":true},{"tex":"S,K,I","display":false},{"tex":"B,C,W","display":false}],"bytes":6944,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":[]}